(text "UART bus A: Mega Serial2 (TX2 D16 via 1k, RX2 D17) -> PDN/UART of DRV1-3 (addr 0,1,2).\nUART bus B: Mega Serial3 (TX3 D14 via 1k, RX3 D15) -> DRV4-6. Gives per-joint load (StallGuard), temperature and open-wire flags." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 375.92 29.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 727c1f80-e459-49d4-ad4f-eae346435c28))
